# astrion-skill v1
goal: Set an alarm for a specific time
trigger:
  - phrase: "wake me up at"
  - phrase: "alarm for"
  - phrase: "set alarm"
do: |
  Parse the user's text for a target time ("7am", "in 8 hours",
  "tomorrow at 6:30"). Persist a 'nova-alarm' record in localStorage
  with the target timestamp; the shell's alarm watcher checks every
  minute and fires when the target is hit. Show a confirmation
  notification with the scheduled time. When the alarm fires, raise
  display brightness gradually + play an alert sound + show a
  dismissible notification.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 250
  reversibility: BOUNDED
